From cad49c8302894c12c34519af4970ff78d9e44957 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 01:21:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] licences: a root NOTICE, and the Apache-2.0 retention the
 S-X8 code required

RELEASE-CHECKLIST.md item 2 said 'no LICENSES/ directory, and no per-source licence file'. That is false at 3f574313f: git ls-files licenses returns 16 tracked files and an audited retention table. The true gap was narrower - no root NOTICE, and no Apache-2.0 text for the S-X8 code the tree carries across 37 files.

S-X8's licence is established, not guessed: the 2026-09-15 capture banks ten files as Apache-2.0 (Marti Vidal Leandro, MarlaLabs, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21922640) with a sha256 each, and 2b0123b0b carries the Apache-2.0 Taken-from. licenses/Apache-2.0.txt is lines 1-176 of the already-retained turboquant-plus copy - the terms, ending at END OF TERMS AND CONDITIONS, because lines 177+ are that licensor's own filled-in copyright block. Nothing is fabricated and the equality is checkable.

Still OWED and recorded in licenses/README.md rather than papered over: the licensor's OWN LICENSE file was never fetched, and closing that needs a network call this lane is barred from making. No per-file headers were added - Apache-2.0 section 4 does not require them, and a header composed here would be our text over the author's name.

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release engineering for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - licence and notice files only, no code path touched.
---
 NOTICE                  |  81 ++++++++++++++++++
 licenses/Apache-2.0.txt | 176 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 licenses/README.md      |  27 ++++++
 3 files changed, 284 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 NOTICE
 create mode 100644 licenses/Apache-2.0.txt

